#  overlayfs refuses to delete it during a build, and it deletes
#  cleanly on a real filesystem.)

# Restore the SELinux policy files dnf left incomplete.
#
# A container build can leave a policy module listed with its files
# missing -- extra_varrun, in this case. Nothing notices until a
# deployment is finalized on a real machine, where refreshing the
# policy fails and takes the deployment with it, which is what
# stopped rpm-ostree from layering a package.
